%I A296778 #17 Oct 28 2026 10:11:26
%S A296778 1,18,184,1800,15136,127008
%N A296778 Detour index of the n-folded cube graph.
%C A296778 The n-folded cube graph is Hamilton-connected for odd n, giving the formula below. In particular, a(9) = 8323200.
%H A296778 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/DetourIndex.html">Detour Index</a>.
%H A296778 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/FoldedCubeGraph.html">Folded Cube Graph</a>.
%H A296778 Eric Weisstein's World of Mathematics, <a href="https://mathworld.wolfram.com/Hamilton-ConnectedGraph.html">Hamilton-Connected Graph</a>.
%F A296778 a(n) = 2^(n - 4)*(2^n - 2)^2 for odd n>=3.
%K A296778 nonn,more,changed
%O A296778 2,2
%A A296778 _Eric W. Weisstein_, Dec 20 2017
